      "spam": false,
      "value": "Actually yes, custom key mapping would be a godsend! I'm not sure how the binded keys to those emotes would go though, especially with the avatars that have the annoying af \"afk_002\" emotes that take like...5 minutes. xD\n\n>Hits Num5\n>Goes to make cup of coffee\n>>opposed to making the coffee anyway\n\nBut it would be cool, less useful for users IN VR though. Since you know, they don't have a numpad attached to their VR gear...although, that'd be cool for some in-game macros!!!",
